# Caddy terminates TLS (automatic Let's Encrypt cert) and reverse-proxies to the Fastify
# process, which stays bound to localhost only — see DEPLOY.md for the firewall setup this
# assumes (only 80/443 reachable from the internet, 8787 not exposed at all).
#
# Replace provider.example.com with your real domain before use.

provider.example.com {
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8787
}
